==About==
<section begin="Intro"/>'''RLCS 2025 ''' is the fourteenth season of the [[Rocket League Championship Series]]. This season features an addition of 1v1s as well as an enhanced update to the league featuring Last Chance Qualifiers and an expansion of World Championship teams from 16 to 20. Like in 2024, 2 splits each have 3 regional opens leading into an international major. The season concludes with the World Championship, that welcomes the best-performing teams in these events and the winners of the new Last Chance Qualifiers.<section end="Intro"/>

The '''RLCS 2025 World Championship''' {{IsTournamentFinished|took|will take|is taking}} place in Décines-Charpieu, Lyon, France at the [https://www.olvallee.fr/accueil-ldlc-arena/ LDLC Arena].

===Format===
*'''Play-In''' - ''September 10th''
** 8-Team GSL Play-In.
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo5}}.
**Top 4 Teams advance to the [[Rocket_League_Championship_Series/2025#Group Stage|Group Stage]].
<br>
* '''Group Stage''' - ''September 11th - 12th''
** 16 teams including the 4 from the  [[Rocket_League_Championship_Series/2025#Play-In|Play-In]].
**Teams are split into 2 GSL Groups of 8.
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo5}}.
**Top 4 teams per group - 8 in total - advance to the [[Rocket_League_Championship_Series/2025#Playoffs|Playoffs]].
<br>
*'''Playoffs''' - ''September 13th - 14th''
**AFL Final Eight system.
**Top 4 of the [[Rocket_League_Championship_Series/2025#Group Stage|Group Stage]] start with two chances before the Final Four, whereas teams ranked 5th-8th start with one chance.
***All matches are {{Abbr/Bo7}}.
<br>
''Crowd Days: September 12th - 14th''

